已知 \(0 < P(A) < 1\) 且 \(P(B + C \mid A) = P(B \mid A) + P(C \mid A)\), 则以下结论:
① \(P(B + C) = P(B) + P(C)\);
② \(P(B + C) = P(B\mid A) + P(C\mid A)\);
③ \(P(B + C|\overline{A}) = P(B|\overline{A}) + P(C|\overline{A});\)
④ \(P(BA + CA) = P(BA) + P(CA)\).
