设 \( y = y(x) \) 满足 \( (xy - 1)\mathrm{d}x + x^{2}\mathrm{d}y = 0, x > 0, y(1) = 0 \), 求
(1) \( y = y(x) \) 的表达式;
(2) 曲线 \( y = y(x) \) 的拐点及渐近线.

设函数 \( f(x) \) 在 \([a,b]\) 上可导, \( c\in(a,b) \), 证明:
(1) 存在一点 \(\xi \in (a, c)\), 使得 \(f(c) - f(a) = f'(\xi)(c - a)\);
(2) 存在一点 \(\eta \in (a, b)\), 使得 \(f(b) - f(a) = f'(\eta)(b - a)\) 且 \(\eta > \xi\).

设向量 \(\alpha_{1} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}, \alpha_{2} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}, \alpha_{3} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}\).
(1) 将  \( \alpha_{1}, \alpha_{2}, \alpha_{3} \)  化成正交单位向量组  \( \gamma_{1}, \gamma_{2}, \gamma_{3} \) ;
(2) 若  \( (\alpha_{1}, \alpha_{2}, \alpha_{3}) = (\gamma_{1}, \gamma_{2}, \gamma_{3}) C \) ，求 C.

设总体X的概率密度为 \( f(x;b)=\left\{\begin{aligned}&ae^{-2(x-b)},x\geqslant b,\\ &0,x<b,\end{aligned}\right. \) 其中 \( b>0,X_{1},X_{2},\cdots,X_{n} \) 是来自总体X的简单随机样本.
(1) 求 a 的值;
(2) 求 b 的矩估计量  \( \hat{b}_{M} \)  与最大似然估计量  \( \hat{b}_{L} \) ;
(3) 计算  \( E(\hat{b}_{L}) \) .
